Since you changed the user configuration, you must rebuild the user environment.
```bash
# As root
nix-shell -c home-manager -A build
# Or run this command directly (recommended)
sudo nix-collect-garbage --delete-old
sudo nixos-rebuild switch --flake ./
```
*Note: Ensure `YOUR_USER` matches in `home.nix` and `home-manager.users.$USER`.*

