### Phase 7: Verification & Optimization

**16. Final Verification Checklist**

| Check | Command |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Boot Time** | `time shutdown reboot` (after restart check boot logs) |
| **GPU Drivers** | `glxinfo` |
| **Wayland Session** | Ensure you log in via the GNOME display manager. If black screen, switch to X11 in GDM. |
