In a "Production Ready" environment, relying on Character Count to determine line count is dangerous (some fonts pack characters tightly, others loosely). It also ignores emojis.

### Corrected "Production Ready" Version (Using Layout Measurement)

Below is the **final, refined version**. This version uses React Native's `NativeModules` capability (via `Text` component internal measurement) more safely by utilizing a hidden `ScrollView` pattern to guarantee that the button only appears when the text actually physically overflows.

