### 1. Cue Package Entry Point (`cue.mod.yaml`)
Defines the root location for the CUE package.
```yaml
cue.mod:
  version: 1
```

### 2. Shared Variables (`vars.cue`)
Centralize all hardcoded values here to enable atomic overrides later.
```cue
// package vars
// Common global configuration for the entire cluster

module homeassistant-cluster:v0.1.0

namespace = "homelab"
image_tag = "latest"

// Resource Limits
limits_cpu = "100m"
limits_mem = "512Mi"
requests_cpu = "50m"
requests_mem = "256Mi"

// Networking
