### 4. Infinite Scroll Wrapper Component (`components/InfiniteScrollTable.vue`)

```vue
<!-- components/InfiniteScrollTable.vue -->
<template>
  <div class="infinite-scroll-container">
    <Table />

    <transition name="fade" mode="out-in">
      <div v-if="isFetching || !usersHasMore" key="loader">
        <div v-if="isFetching" class="loading-spinner">Loading...</div>
        <div v-else class="no-more-results">No more results to load</div>
      </div>
